points as you proposed (forecast RMSE/NLL at horizons, autocorrelation consistency at multiple lags, Wasserstein-1 on increments, training stability, scale of cost curve). (h) Statistical analysis = minimum 3 random seeds per arm, paired comparison by seed, paired bootstrap 95 % CIs on the primary endpoint, pre-registered before any (hypothetical) result is observed. (i) setup_4 and setup_5 to be carried as a single unified design with two arms (Attention baseline, Hyena treatment) sharing one backbone, dataset, schedule and evaluation stack; an optional sub-arm separating causal vs. non-causal Hyena may be included as a clearly labelled secondary analysis, not as a primary endpoint. (j) Sequence elements treated as continuous-valued. (k) Feasibility: include a 'wiring sanity' plan (tiny synthetic sequence, a few hundred steps, qualitatively correct denoising in both arms) as the only execution-grade check that could in principle be performed outside this sandbox, with a clear caveat that no run is reported here. Controls must explicitly enumerate what is held fixed (spatial mixing, conditioning pathway, embeddings, optimiser, schedule, batch, seed, noise schedule, sampling procedure, NFE, solver, preprocessing). Please also list residual risks and the conditions under which the design's conclusions would be invalidated.\", \"required_handoff_stage\": \"result\", \"approach_approved\": true}"}], "tool_calls": null, "tool_call_id": null, "name": null}, "llm_response_id": null, "activated_skills": [], "extended_content": [], "sender": null, "kind": "MessageEvent", "source_event_index": 22}
